Package: UnitTrans
Type: Package
Title: Distributions on the Unit Interval via Transformations of
        Baseline Laws
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mohamad Yamen", "Al-Mohamad", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "almohamadmohamad678@gmail.com")
Description: Builds new probability distributions on (0,1) by applying a
    monotone transformation (rational, exponential, logit, arcsecant-hyperbolic,
    probit, complementary log-log) to a baseline random variable Y with any
    available d/p/q/r functions. Provides density, distribution, quantile and
    random generation functions, maximum likelihood fitting with information
    criteria, automatic model search over baseline/transformation pairs,
    goodness-of-fit tests with parametric bootstrap, moments, hazard and
    simulation studies.
